small3dlib / tinyphysicsengine demos for Rockbox (YP3 port)

Upstream (CC0 1.0, LICENSE.txt, tpe_LICENSE.txt):
  https://gitlab.com/drummyfish/small3dlib          c986e9b025a14d6cdcd0ca58e6a14e6e4396ed93
  https://gitlab.com/drummyfish/tinyphysicsengine   995316e5f86c1fd2ff13d56b3a65ac5e4bdc78c8
small3dlib.h, tinyphysicsengine.h and the *Model.h files are unmodified
(tpe_arenaModel.h / tpe_carModel.h are tinyphysicsengine's car models,
renamed to avoid clashing with small3dlib's car). textures.h is generated by
maketex.py from the upstream example textures (shrunk to 64x64 RGB565).
Rockbox glue: s3l_main.h (menu/input/framebuffer), tpe_helper.h (condensed
from tinyphysicsengine's programs/helper.h).
